        ┌──────────────┐                                                           
        │ TUI          │───┐                                                       
        └──────────────┘   │   ┌─────────────────────┐      ┌──────────┐           
                           ├──▶│ Local worklog store │ ───▶ │ JIRA     │           
        ┌──────────────┐   │   └─────────────────────┘      └──────────┘           
        │ MCP client   │───┘                                                       
        └──────────────┘                                                           
                                                                                   
  MCP tools can fetch issues, add and inspect worklogs, and sync them to JIRA.     
                                                                                   
               The TUI and MCP server use the same local worklogs.                 
                                                                                   
                              $ punchout mcp serve                                 
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
 punchout   4 / 6    h/← previous   space/l/→ next   esc/q quit   ] change theme   